{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":23022,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793363892321,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":1980,"episodeCount":52,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uYjObymj5YTZnP2jzrUMAaylBMI.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"618676","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"La nascita di Astroboy","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Dr Boynton is so driven by his work as a robot engineer thst he neglects his promise to spend time with his son Toby at an amusement park.  As Toby leaves the park, he is caught in a traffic collision.  Before dying, Toby has his father promise him to make the new robot in his image and treat it like a son.  Overcome with grief, Boynton completes the project and brings \"Toby\" to life.  Unknown to Dr Boynton, a shady criminal called Skunk stole the plans for \"Toby\" and plans to make a robot of his own with a new circuit known as the Omega Factor.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1980-10-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x0MSPZIiQO1CbbvC1BjgcjpyI3t.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x0MSPZIiQO1CbbvC1BjgcjpyI3t.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23022/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"618677","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Atlas","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Dr. Boynton and Toby depart on an ocean liner for America.  Not knowing his own strength, Toby causes a huge mess during dinner.  Angrily, Dr Boynton rejects Toby on the spot, declaring that he's just a robot and that he has no son.  Meanwhile, Skunk attempts to teach Atlas his criminal ways and eventually takes Atlas on a mission to steel gold from the same boat that Dr Boynton and Toby are on...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1980-10-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pZGQBvtOpKU8zUR6Z0jxKwmlgx5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pZGQBvtOpKU8zUR6Z0jxKwmlgx5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23022/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"618678","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Il circo dei robot","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Toby has been enslaved by a robot circus owner and is forced into manual labour.  There he befriends a young circus worker named Kathy.  Dr Boynton's associate, Professor Elefun, comes to fetch Toby but the ringmaster refuses to let him go...  Toby receives his new name, \"Astro\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1980-10-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/15pR3wP661LxSZPnK4pbaeI9Oen.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/15pR3wP661LxSZPnK4pbaeI9Oen.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23022/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"618679","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"SOS compagni di classe in pericolo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rescued from the circus by Dr. Elefun, Astro Boy starts school and struggles with the bullying from classmates for being a robot.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1980-10-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zjmWiMLUMbZz8A6LVvzel0pdPAJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjmWiMLUMbZz8A6LVvzel0pdPAJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/23022/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"618680","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Il ritorno di Atlas","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Astro's must stop Atlas' scheme to enslave humanity by series of technological thefts, one of which involves Astro's proposed robotic parents.","language":